  <iati-identifier>NL-KVK-83517626-DGGF117CO1</iati-identifier>
  <reporting-org ref="NL-KVK-83517626" secondary-reporter="1" type="70">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Invest international B.V.</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Local meat for local need; from Farm to Fork</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">With the support of an loan through DGGF a Dutch SME will be able to invest in the expansion of the already existing pig husbandry and will be able to start an abattoir in Colombia. It concerns an expansion of an investment derived from a recently completed PSI project. The Joint Venture has successfully set up a pig husbandry and training facility with a subsidy from the PSI programme. Their strategy was to produce affordable quality meat through an innovative pig husbandry which would also function as a training facility for local pig farmers. It&#x2019;s a successful concept, the husbandry is in full production and there&#x2019;s enough demand for training.The entrepreneurs want to expand the production to 640 sow and vertically integrate the abattoir into the chain. This &#x2018;vertically integration&#x2019; is world-wide visible and the main advantage is retaining the margins and quality / retaining margins and quality are it&#x2019;s main advantages. DGGF endorses this strategy.Support through Technical Assistance will be discussed with the entrepreneurs.</narrative>
  </description>
